release/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.dot
*.log
*.ign
.earth/
vue/node_modules/
release/
*.log

# Secrets never belong in this repo — the chain takes its config from config.yml
# locally and from the SDL's env block when deployed. This is here because a bare
# `.env` pattern in the backend repo matched only that exact name, and a
# `.env.local` carrying a wallet mnemonic reached a public repository through the
# gap. `.env*` covers the family.
.env*

# Built binaries. `go build ./tools/poafixtures` drops one at the repo root; it is
# regenerable with `go run ./tools/poafixtures` and was only ever committed by
# accident.
/poafixtures
/earthd

# Native verifier libraries built by third_party/barretenberg-go/scripts/build-wrapper.sh.
# darwin_arm64 stays tracked — it is the development platform, and a fresh clone
# would otherwise have to fetch ~100MB from Aztec before it could build at all.
# Everything else is produced by CI per platform and must not be committed: each
# is ~50MB of object code.
third_party/barretenberg-go/lib/*
!third_party/barretenberg-go/lib/darwin_arm64/

# Docusaurus. node_modules and the build output are regenerated by `npm ci` and
# `npm run build`; .docusaurus is its incremental cache.
docs-site/node_modules/
docs-site/build/
docs-site/.docusaurus/
